---
// Hover cards: the author card, queried from each co-author's own Linked Data with
// Comunica, and the publication card, queried from dblp.
//
// The script below and the co-author graph's (`CoauthorGraph.astro`, publications page
// only) are the JavaScript this repository itself ships to the browser. The other two are
// third-party and inline: the analytics tag on every page, and RunKit on the three posts
// that embed a notebook.
//
// Astro does not inline it. It only inlines a `<script>` with no imports, and this one
// imports, so the built pages carry `<script type="module" src="/_astro/FoafTooltip…js">`
// — around 7 KB, 2.9 KB gzipped. With no `Cache-Control` header on the server today that
// is revalidated on every navigation.
//
// It goes on every page rather than only the ones with a bibliography: it looks for
// `a.author[resource]` or a title link and returns immediately when there is none, which is
// cheaper than deciding per layout which pages carry authors.
//
// Comunica itself is not here. `worker-client.ts` reaches it through `new Worker(...)`, so
// Vite emits it as a separate chunk that is only fetched once a reader hovers a name.
---
<script>
  import '../scripts/foaf-tooltip.ts'
</script>
